---
title: Frontend Galaxy Directive Processing
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant ext as (caller)
    participant galaxy as MarkdownGalaxy.vue
    participant validate as Validation
    participant stores as Pinia Stores
    participant api as API
    participant element as Element<br>Component

    ext->>galaxy: directive block
    activate galaxy

    galaxy->>galaxy: parse directive<br>name + args

    galaxy->>validate: check directive
    activate validate
    Note right of validate: Mode-aware:<br>- Available in page/report?<br>- Valid object reference?
    validate-->>galaxy: valid / error
    deactivate validate

    alt validation passed
        galaxy->>stores: fetch data
        activate stores
        alt cache hit
            stores-->>galaxy: cached data
        else cache miss
            stores->>api: request
            activate api
            api-->>stores: response
            deactivate api
            stores-->>galaxy: fresh data
        end
        deactivate stores

        galaxy->>element: render with data
        activate element
        element-->>galaxy: rendered UI
        deactivate element
    else validation failed
        galaxy->>galaxy: show error alert
    end

    galaxy-->>ext: rendered output
    deactivate galaxy
